00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
Find your magic

2
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Upside-Down Magic is a fantasy, family, tv movie film directed by Joe Nussbaum.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Nory and her best friend Reina enter the Sage Academy for Magical Studies, where Nory’s
unconventional powers land her in a class for those with wonky, or “upside-down,” magic.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Undaunted, Nory sets out to prove that that upside-down
magic can be just as powerful as right-side-up.

5
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Nory Boxwood Horace, played by Izabela Rose.

6
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Reina Carvajal, played by Siena Agudong.

7
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
