11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Upside-Down Magic is a 2020 American fantasy film
released as a Disney Channel Original Movie.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
It is an adaptation of the eponymous fantasy book series by
Sarah Mlynowski, Lauren Myracle, and Emily Jenkins.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film stars Izabela Rose and Siena Agudong and co-starring Vicki Lewis.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
It premiered on Disney Channel on July 31, 2020.

15
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of friendship, magic,
supernatural, young heroes, good versus evil.
